}}, "time": {"label": "Time", "category": {"index": {"2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 1, "2025-03": 2, "2025-04": 3, "2025-05": 4, "2025-06": 5, "2025-07": 6, "2025-08": 7, "2025-09": 8, "2025-10": 9, "2025-11": 10, "2025-12": 11, "2026-01": 12, "2026-02": 13, "2026-03": 14, "2026-04": 15, "2026-05": 16, "2026-06": 17, "2026-07": 18, "2026-08": 19, "2026-09": 20, "2026-10": 21}, "label": {"2025-01": "2025-01", "2025-02": "2025-02", "2025-03": "2025-03", "2025-04": "2025-04", "2025-05": "2025-05", "2025-06": "2025-06", "2025-07": "2025-07", "2025-08": "2025-08", "2025-09": "2025-09", "2025-10": "2025-10", "2025-11": "2025-11", "2025-12": "2025-12", "2026-01": "2026-01", "2026-02": "2026-02", "2026-03": "2026-03", "2026-04": "2026-04", "2026-05": "2026-05", "2026-06": "2026-06", "2026-07": "2026-07", "2026-08": "2026-08", "2026-09": "2026-09", "2026-10": "2026-10"}}}}, "extension": {"lang": "EN", "description": "<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP)\u202fmeasures price changes\u202fof\u202fvarious consumer goods and services\u202fover time\u202f(inflation). This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification&nbsp;of Individual Consumption&nbsp;According to Purpose (ECOICOP)&nbsp;ver. 2, available in base years 2025=100 and 2015=100.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This dataset includes&nbsp;four monthly&nbsp;indicators:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the index,\u202fmeasuring\u202fprice changes\u202fin relation to\u202fa\u202fbase year&nbsp;</li><li>the annual rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in a reference month compared to the same month of the previous year (also called annual inflation)&nbsp;</li><li>the monthly rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in consumer price indices in a reference month compared to the previous month (also called monthly inflation)</li><li>the\u202f12-month average rate of change,&nbsp;comparing\u202fthe average index over a 12-month period to the average index previous 12-month period.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>All the rates are calculated from the monthly HICP indices.&nbsp;</p>", "id": "PRC_HICP_MINR", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "1.0", "datastructure": {"id": "PRC_HICP_MINR", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "26.0"}, "annotation": [{"type": "CREATED", "date": "2026-01-27T09:31:20+0100"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML", "title": "<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf", "text": "Information note"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE", "title": "DATASET"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_DATA", "date": "2026-11-04T11:00:00+0100"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_GLOBAL", "date": "2026-11-04T11:00:00+0100"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_PLANNED", "date": "2026-11-04T11:00:00+0100"}, {"type": "ESMS_HTML", "title": "Explanatory texts (metadata)", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/p